{
  "id": "HEB.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "HEB",
  "reference": "Ndị Hibru 10",
  "copyright": "Biblica® Open Igbo Contemporary Bible™ Copyright © 1980, 1988, 2019, 2020 by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 39,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HEB 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kraịst chụrụ aja naanị otu ugboro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwu ahụ bụ naanị onyinyo na-egosi ihe ọma gaje ịbịa. Nʼihi ya, o zughị oke nʼonwe ya isite nʼaja ndị ahụ a na-achụ mgbe mgbe kwa afọ, mee ka ndị ahụ na-abịaru nso ife ofufe zuo oke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma ọ bụghị otu a, ọ bụ na a gabeghị akwụsị ịchụ aja ndị a? Ọ bụrụ na a sachapụla njọ ndị na-efe ofufe na mbụ, akọnuche ha agaghịkwa ama ha ikpe mmehie ha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma nke bụ eziokwu bụ na ihe aja ndị a na-eme bụ ichetara ha mmehie ha kwa afọ niile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼihi na ọ bụ ihe na-apụghị ime eme na ọbara oke ehi na nke ụmụ ewu dị iche iche ga-asachapụ mmehie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya mere mgbe Kraịst bịara nʼụwa, ọ sịrị,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 10:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Aja na onyinye abụghị ihe ị chọrọ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 10:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kama ị kwadoro ahụ nye m.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aja nsure ọkụ na aja a chụrụ maka mmehie,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 10:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ha abụghị ihe dị ezi mma nye gị.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mgbe ahụ ka m sịrị, 'Lee, abịala m Chineke m, ime ihe ị na-achọ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 10:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nke a bụkwa ihe e dere banyere m nʼime akwụkwọ mpịakọta.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O kwuru na mbụ, \"Aja dị iche iche, na onyinye, na aja nsure ọkụ na aja mmehie adịghị atọ gị ụtọ, ha adịghịkwa amasị gị\" (a chụrụ aja ndị a dịka iwu si dị).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O kwukwara ọzọ, \"Lee abịala m ime uche gị.\" Ọ kagburu aja nke mbụ ahụ ma were aja nke abụọ dochie nʼọnọdụ ya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Site nʼime uche Chineke, e mere ka anyị dị nsọ site nʼaja Jisọs Kraịst ji onwe ya chụọ naanị otu ugboro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aja Kraịst chụrụ zubigara oke",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye nchụaja ọbụla na-eguzo kwa ụbọchị na-efe ofufe, na-achụkwa otu aja ahụ ugboro ugboro, bụ aja nke na-enweghị ike ịsachapụ mmehie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma mgbe Kraịst chụchara naanị otu aja ahụ, otu ugboro nʼihi mmehie niile, ọ nọdụrụ ala nʼaka nri Chineke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebe ahụ ka ọ nọ ugbu a na-eche ka ndị iro ya niile bụrụ ihe mgbakwasị ụkwụ ya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼihi na o sitela nʼotu aja mee ka ndị ahụ a na-eme ka ha dịrị nsọ zuo oke mgbe niile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mmụọ nsọ na-agbakwara anyị ama banyere ihe ndị a mgbe o buru ụzọ kwuo:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Nke a bụ ọgbụgba ndụ ahụ mụ na ha ga-agba",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 10:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "mgbe oge ndị ahụ gasịrị, ka Onyenwe anyị kwuru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 10:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aga m etinye iwu m nʼobi ha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 10:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aga m edekwasịkwa ha nʼuche ha.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O kwukwara sị,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 10:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Agaghị m echetakwa mmehie ha",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 10:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "na mmebi iwu ha niile ọzọ.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya mere, ebe ọ bụ na a gbagharala mmehie ndị a, ọ dịkwaghị mkpa ịchụ ajọ ọzọ maka mgbaghara mmehie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ọkpụkpọ oku banyere inwe mkpebi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼihi nke a, ụmụnna m, ebe anyị nwere nkwuwa okwu ịbanye nʼEbe Kachasị Nsọ site nʼọbara Jisọs,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bụ ụzọ ọhụrụ nke o meghere nye anyị, nke dị ọhụrụ ma dịkwa ndụ site nʼakwa mgbochi ahụ nke bụ ahụ ya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebe anyị nwekwara onye nchụaja dị ukwuu, nke na-elekọta ụlọ Chineke,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka anyị bịaruo nso site nʼobi dị ọcha, na ntụkwasị obi zuru ezu nke okwukwe, ka anyị bụrụ ndị a sachara obi ha site nʼakọnuche rụrụ arụ, ka anyị bụrụkwa ndị e ji mmiri dị ezigbo ọcha sachaa ahụ anyị.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya mere, ka anyị jidesie nkwupụta nke olileanya anyị ike, nʼihi na onye ahụ kwere nkwa kwesiri ntụkwasị obi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka anyị tụgharịa uche otu anyị ga-esi kpalie ibe anyị nʼịhụnanya na ezi ọrụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka anyị gharakwa ichefu nzukọ anyị dị ka ụfọdụ na-eme, kama ka anyị na-agbarịta onwe anyị ume, karịsịa, ugbu a ụbọchị ahụ na-abịa nso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ịdọ aka na ntị banyere mmehie",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọ bụrụ na anyị akpachapụ anya na-anọgide na mmehie mgbe anyị matachara eziokwu ahụ, o nwekwaghị aja ọzọ fọdụrụ a ga-achụ banyere mmehie niile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama naanị ikpe dị oke egwu, nke ga-adị ka ọkụ na-ere ike ike, nke ga-erechapụ ndị niile bụ ndị iro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye ọbụla dara iwu Mosis, na-anwụ na-enweghị ebere, site nʼakaebe mmadụ abụọ maọbụ atọ gbara megide ya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọ bụrụ na ọ dị otu a, olee ụdị ahụhụ unu chere na a ga-enye onye lelịrị Ọkpara Chineke, gịnị ka a ga-eme onye merụrụ ọbara nke ọgbụgba ndụ nke e ji doo ya nsọ, na onye kpasuru mmụọ nke amara ahụ iwe?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼihi na anyị maa onye ahụ kwurunụ, \"Ịbọ ọbọ dịrị m, aga m akwụghachi,\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ọzọkwa, \"Onyenwe anyị ga-ekpe ndị ya ikpe.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọ bụ ihe dị oke egwu ịdaba nʼaka Chineke dị ndụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma chetakwanụ ụbọchị mbụ ndị ahụ, mgbe unu natachara ìhè, unu nọgidesikwara ike nʼagbanyeghị oke ahụhụ niile unu tara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mgbe ụfọdụ, a kparịrị unu nʼihu ọha, unu natakwara mkpagbu. Nʼoge ọzọ, unu soro ndị e si otu a mesoo mmeso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unu were obi ebere soro ndị nọ nʼụlọ mkpọrọ taa ahụhụ, unu jikwa ọṅụ nabata ya mgbe a nakọrọchara unu ihe niile unu nwere, nʼihi na unu onwe unu matara na unu nwere ihe ka mma, nke na-anọgide.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya mere, unu ahapụkwala ntụkwasị obi unu ahụ, nʼihi na ọ na-eweta ụgwọ ọrụ dị ukwuu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼihi ya, unu kwesiri inwe ndidi ka ọ ga-abụ na mgbe unu mere uche Chineke unu ga-anata ihe e kwere na nkwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼihi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 10:37"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Na oge na-adịghị anya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 10:37"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "onye ahụ nke na-abịa ga-abịa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 10:37"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ọ gaghị anọkwa ọdụ.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 10:38"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Onye ezi omume nkem ga-esite nʼokwukwe dị ndụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 10:38"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mkpụrụobi m agaghị e nwee mmasị",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 10:38"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nʼime onye ọbụla na-alaghachi azụ.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma anyị abụghị ndị na-alaghachi azụ si otu a laa nʼiyi. Kama anyị dịnyere ndị nwere okwukwe, bụrụkwa ndị a zọpụtara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
